Description: track work time by activity and report it by weekday
 timesheet records when work starts and stops, and on what, in a plain-text
 log. It lists and totals the log by activity and weekday, fills in a PDF
 timesheet form, and mails it through the local sendmail.
 .
 While a session is open, a reminder daemon asks every so often what is being
 worked on, through a desktop chooser (PyQt, kdialog or zenity) and desktop
 notifications.
